<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<%@ include file="../fragments/header.jspf" %><article class="detail"><p class="eyebrow">MY TRAVEL PLAN</p><h1 class="page-title"><c:out value="${plan.title}"/></h1><p class="muted"><c:out value="${plan.startDate}"/> ~ <c:out value="${plan.endDate}"/> · 예산 <c:out value="${plan.budget}"/>원 · 등록한 경비 <c:out value="${totalCost}"/>원</p><p class="prose"><c:out value="${plan.description}"/></p><h2>여행 동선</h2><p class="muted">여행지를 끌어 순서를 바꾼 뒤 ‘순서 저장’을 눌러주세요. 같은 일차 안에서 방문 순서가 반영됩니다.</p><div class="leaflet-map" data-map data-route="stops" aria-label="일정의 여행지와 방문 순서 지도"></div><p class="muted">선을 따라 방문 순서를 확인하세요. 선은 지점 간 연결이며 실제 도로 길찾기 경로는 아닙니다.</p><div id="stops"><c:forEach var="stop" items="${stops}"><div class="list-item" draggable="true" data-stop-id="${stop.id}" data-lat="${stop.latitude}" data-lon="${stop.longitude}" data-title="<c:out value='${stop.title}'/>"><span class="tag">${stop.dayNumber}일차</span><h3><c:out value="${stop.title}"/></h3><p class="muted"><c:out value="${stop.address}"/> · <c:out value="${stop.cost}"/>원</p><p class="prose"><c:out value="${stop.notes}"/></p><div class="row"><a class="button secondary small" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=${stop.latitude}&amp;mlon=${stop.longitude}#map=15/${stop.latitude}/${stop.longitude}">지도에서 보기</a><form method="post" action="<c:url value='/plans/remove'/>"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="${sessionScope.csrf}"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="${plan.id}"><input type="hidden" name="stop" value="${stop.id}"><button class="link">일정에서 빼기</button></form><button type="button" class="link" data-move="up">위로</button><button type="button" class="link" data-move="down">아래로</button></div></div></c:forEach></div><form method="post" action="<c:url value='/plans/reorder'/>" id="reorder-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="${sessionScope.csrf}"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="${plan.id}"><input type="hidden" name="order" id="stop-order"><button class="button secondary">순서 저장</button></form><section class="form-card"><h2>여행지 추가</h2><p class="muted">여행지 상세 화면의 ‘일정에 담기’를 사용하거나 관광지 번호를 입력하세요.</p><form method="post" action="<c:url value='/plans/add'/>"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="${sessionScope.csrf}"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="${plan.id}"><div class="field"><label for="contentId">관광지 번호</label><input id="contentId" name="contentId" inputmode="numeric" required maxlength="12" value="<c:out value='${param.contentId}'/>"></div><div class="field"><label for="day">여행 일차</label><input id="day" name="day" type="number" min="1" max="${days}" value="1" required></div><div class="field"><label for="cost">예상 경비 (원)</label><input id="cost" name="cost" type="number" min="0" value="0"></div><div class="field"><label for="notes">메모</label><textarea id="notes" name="notes" maxlength="1000"></textarea></div><button class="primary">여행지 추가</button></form></section><form method="post" action="<c:url value='/plans/delete'/>" data-confirm="여행 일정 전체를 삭제할까요?"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="${sessionScope.csrf}"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="${plan.id}"><button class="button danger">여행 삭제</button></form></article><%@ include file="../fragments/footer.jspf" %>
